OL,5,GUK Weather Forecast                    
OL,7,GToday:FCloud and rain clears the south 
OL,8,Fthrough the morning, with some sunny   
OL,9,Fspells developing later. Chillier, but 
OL,10,Fbrighter further North, with a few     
OL,11,Fscattered showers along North Sea      
OL,12,Fcoasts, turning wintery in the far     
OL,13,Fnorth. A chillier day for most.        
OL,15,GTonight:FLargely dry, though some      
OL,16,Fshowers in the far north. Clear skies  
OL,17,Fallow for widespread frost             
OL,18,Fdevelopment. With light winds, fog     
OL,19,Fpatches develop across central and     
OL,20,Fsouthern England and Northern Ireland. 
OL,23,D]C        From the Met Office          
